      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-01-2023-june/q3",
      "question": "<p><strong>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</strong></p><p><strong>Solutions relying on calculator technology are not acceptable.</strong></p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_1=-4+4\\mathrm i\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_1\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r(\\cos\\theta+\\mathrm i\\sin\\theta)\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\\in\\mathbb R\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r&gt;0\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0\\leqslant\\theta&lt;2\\pi\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_2=3\\left(\\cos\\frac{17\\pi}{12}+\\mathrm i\\sin\\frac{17\\pi}{12}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Determine in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a+\\mathrm ib\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are exact real numbers,<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{z_1}{z_2}\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(z_2\\right)^4\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol></li><li>Show on a single Argand diagram<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>the complex numbers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_1\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_2\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{z_1}{z_2}\"></span></li><li>the region defined by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:\\left|z-z_1\\right|&lt;\\left|z-z_2\\right|\\right\\}\"></span></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
